# kenn store: committed data stays tracked — `pack-*.bin` files (CI-produced)
# in any sidecar generation dir and `findings/<id>.md` records. Dev-local
# `seg-*.bin` files are excluded; `kenn index --repack` promotes them. The
# GC bookkeeping (`.last-access` stamps, `gc.lock`) and sidecar scratch are
# local-only. The derived store (runs/, live, index.lock, readers/) is
# rebuilt per worktree; when it lives under `.kenn/` it is excluded by the
# derived-root line appended after these.
vectors/**/seg-*.bin
vectors/**/.last-access
vectors/.tmp/
vectors/gc.lock
findings/.tmp/
# `atlas` is a convenience symlink to the current OKF atlas bundle, replaced on
# each index. It points at the RESOLVED run directory under the derived store —
# never through `live`, which is a pointer FILE and not traversable; linking
# through it is what left this dangling before.
atlas
local/
